  PART 8: Semantic Verification
==========================================================================

Verifying cyclic group properties by comparing compiled unitaries:
  Phase rotation applied n times (for n-th roots of unity) = identity

  ✓ Z2: CZ^2 = id (involution) (fidelity=1.000000)
  ✓ Z4: (CS;CZ)^4 = id (4th roots cycle) (fidelity=1.000000)
  ✓ Z5: phase^10 = id (5th roots, Rz period) (fidelity=1.000000)

